note: PACKAGECONFIG rows: OE-Core's base.bbclass adds the build (field 3) and runtime (field 4) dependencies of the selected options with anonymous python, which is not run; they are listed from the flags
note: each recipe providing one of these is built with its own build dependencies (deps <recipe>); what do_package adds (the shared-library and pkg-config RDEPENDS, debian renames) is known only after a build: pkgdata package_info shows it
